# Image attachments (screenshots, photos of dashboards) are opaque to text-only
# and container agents: the download URL is auth-walled (an agent holds only its
# own token, not a user session) and Agent Zero's /api_message takes a plain
# string, not vision blocks. So at upload we OCR images to a .txt sidecar and
# inline that text into agent prompts — the same "readable text" path Office docs
